wh40k-faction-edit-profile = Edit profile and ranks
wh40k-faction-editor-title = Faction profile
wh40k-faction-editor-scope = Edit admission requirements, additional sections and rank names here. The faction's name, emblem and lore are defined separately.
wh40k-faction-editor-profile-tab = Public profile
wh40k-faction-editor-ranks-tab = Rank names
wh40k-faction-editor-admission = Admission requirements
wh40k-faction-editor-admission-hint = This text appears under “How to join”. Leave it empty to use the standard application instructions.
wh40k-faction-editor-admission-placeholder = Who you are looking for, whom to contact, requirements for joining…
wh40k-faction-editor-sections = Additional sections
wh40k-faction-editor-sections-hint = Up to three expandable sections for rules, contacts or faction activities. Fill in both the title and text. Clear both fields to remove a section.
wh40k-faction-editor-section-number = Section {$number}
wh40k-faction-editor-section-title = Section title
wh40k-faction-editor-section-text = Text shown when a player expands this section…
wh40k-faction-editor-count = {$count} / {$max}
wh40k-faction-editor-section-count = Title: {$title}/{$titleMax} · Text: {$text}/{$textMax}
wh40k-faction-editor-ranks-hint = One name per level, up to 32 characters. An empty field keeps the standard name. Permissions and rank order remain the same.
wh40k-faction-editor-leader-permissions = Review applications, remove members and officers, appoint officers, edit the profile and access faction storage.
wh40k-faction-editor-officer-permissions = Accept or reject applications, remove members and access faction storage. Cannot change ranks or the profile.
wh40k-faction-editor-member-permissions = View the profile and roster, leave the faction. No management or storage access.
wh40k-faction-editor-reset-ranks = Restore standard names
wh40k-faction-editor-cancel = Close
wh40k-faction-editor-preview = Preview
wh40k-faction-editor-save = Save
wh40k-faction-editor-preview-hint = Public profile preview · changes have not been saved
wh40k-faction-editor-timeout = The response is delayed. Close the editor and refresh the faction before editing again.
wh40k-faction-profile-saved = Profile and rank names saved.
wh40k-faction-profile-invalid = Check field lengths. Each section needs a title and text; rank names and section titles must not repeat. Line breaks are only allowed in body text.
wh40k-faction-profile-conflict = The profile has changed. Your text remains in the fields: copy anything you need, close the editor and reopen it to load the current profile.
wh40k-faction-rank-action-hint = New rank: {$rank}
wh40k-faction-custom-ranks-help =
    {$leader} — leads the faction, appoints officers, manages the roster, applications and public profile.
    {$officer} — reviews applications and removes members.
    {$member} — belongs to the faction and can view its roster.
    Faction storage is available to the two senior ranks.
